# Track the canonical machine configs; ignore any extras the user adds locally.
*
!.gitignore
!default.yaml
!gpu_example.yaml
# rci*.yaml is a shared CTU cluster, not a personal box. Two shapes, because
# one file cannot describe both node types: rci.yaml is the AMD CPU node
# (a[01-16], no GPU), rci_gpu.yaml the AMD GPU node (g[01-12], A100).
!rci.yaml
!rci_gpu.yaml
!README.md
